        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Longines, The Swatch Group\n- People: Auguste Agassiz, Nicolas Hayek\n- Places: Saint-Imier, Switzerland\n- Organizations: ASUAG, SSIH\n- Events: 2015 World's Best Racehorse Rankings\n\nFacts:\n- Longines is a luxury watch company based in Saint-Imier, Switzerland.\n- Longines was founded by Auguste Agassiz in 1832.\n- The Swatch Group was founded in 1983 by Nicolas Hayek through the merger of ASUAG and SSIH.\n- The Swatch Group is a Swiss manufacturer of watches and jewelry.\n- Longines is currently owned by the Swatch Group.\n- Longines sponsored the 2015 World's Best Racehorse Rankings, which was the 2015 edition of the World's Best Racehorse Rankings.",
